      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow4:273",
        "answer": "With a cursor, computes bounds centered on the target. Animated path plays Release, begins50ms movement, updates bounds, and registers its focus/selection helper on transition completion; direct path updates bounds and calls it now. That helper chooses Snap/Acquire, sends gain_focus, stores selectedRegion and sends SpawnRegionFocus only for the written lobby mode or simulatedCT. Requests target lose_focus then DefaultClip, clears selectedRegion and hides cursor only when the keep-visible argument is falsy. Gets the stick vector, negates y in that same table and stores it on the receiver. Collects beacons whose native hit-test contains the cursor, computes squared center distance, sorts by ascending distance with its owned comparator, and returns first marker or nil. Equal-distance tie order is unspecified. Missing SpawnSelectionMap returns. Found target optionally deselects old region, s [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
